<title>MALAYSIA: Leader Universal H1 net off 20.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Leader Universal H1 net off 20.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		  (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     50.53	 vs	63.66</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    11.6	  vs	14.7</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)    5.0	  vs	 5.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		524.57	 vs     457.21</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 70.56	 vs	90.03</p>
<p>    Minorities		0.11	 vs less  0.37</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Leader Universal Holdings Bhd. It is involved in property development and making and selling cables.</p>
